                "account": "RangeOrder"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "position_token_account",
          "docs": [
            "Optional for the owner: the NFT may have changed hands or the position been closed, and the order",
            "must still be closable. When given and still delegated to this order, the delegation is revoked.",
